      "id": "box_ai_label", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 208, "width": 250, "height": 184,
      "text": "SAP DAR Ops\n\n1. Confidence Gauge\n   Avg MODEL_CONFIDENCE: 94%\n   [Visual: 0-100% gauge]\n\n2. Attack Distribution (Pie)\n   DDoS: 45% | SQLi: 30% | Brute: 25%\n   SELECT ATTACK_CATEGORY, COUNT(*)\n   FROM V_ALERTS_24H\n   WHERE IS_ATTACK=1\n   GROUP BY ATTACK_CATEGORY\n\n3. Top Threat IPs (Bar)\n   192.168.1.100 (120)\n   10.0.0.50 (85)\n\n4. Last Training\n   2026-04-12 06:23:20 UTC\n   FROM ML_ARTIFACTS metadata",
