    {
      "id": "box_net_label", "type": "text", "x": 340, "y": 208, "width": 300, "height": 184,
      "text": "Network Intelligence\n\n1. Mapa de Calor Tráfico\n   [Heatmap SRC_IP → DST_IP]\n   SELECT SRC_IP, DST_IP, COUNT(*)\n   FROM V_ALERTS_24H\n   GROUP BY SRC_IP, DST_IP\n\n2. Ports in Danger (Top 10)\n   80 (4.5K)  443 (3.2K)  8080 (1.8K)\n   SELECT DST_PORT, COUNT(*)\n   WHERE IS_ATTACK=1\n   GROUP BY DST_PORT\n\n3. Duration vs Flow Scatter\n   [Detección de anomalías]\n   SELECT DURATION, FLOW_BYTES_PER_S\n   WHERE IS_ATTACK=1\n   (tráfico lento con muchos datos = sospechoso)",
